    <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="Client Registry " id="id-155546edf11e437993e4b3336fd1151a">
      <documentation>Client Registry (Master Patient Index, Identity Provider). Manages metadata about patients or clients, demographic details, unique identifiers, and relationships among records (e.g., merged or linked identities). Provides unique, verifiable patient identity to link records across sources.&#xD;
&#xD;
 &#xD;
 	&#xD;
Client Registry (Master Patient Index, Identity Provider)&#xD;
2.1 Identification and registration of persons (2.1.1 to 2.1.2)&#xD;
2.2 Person-centred health records (2.2.1 to 2.2.4)&#xD;
2.4 Telemedicine (2.4.1 to 2.4.4) patient identity required for linking with provider&#xD;
2.9 Prescription and medication management (2.9.1 to 2.9.3) identifies correct patient record&#xD;
2.10 Laboratory and diagnostics imaging (2.10.1 to 2.10.4) associates test results to correct patient&#xD;
3.8.1 Register and store current health certificate&#xD;
3.8.2 Retrieve and validate current health certificate&#xD;
3.8.3 Revoke and update health certificate&#xD;
</documentation>
    </element>
    <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="Health Worker Registry " id="id-a1d3aa2e458c4163bba9f53edbfc34a0">
      <documentation>Health Worker Registry (licensing, verification system): Stores metadata about health professionals, licensing status, qualifications, roles, and identifiers. Links data entries to verified providers&#xD;
&#xD;
Health Worker Registry (Licensing and Verification System)&#xD;
2.2 Person-centred health records (2.2.1 to 2.2.4) clinician identity on documentation&#xD;
2.3 Healthcare provider decision support (2.3.1 to 2.3.3)&#xD;
2.4 Telemedicine (2.4.1 to 2.4.4) verified provider identity&#xD;
2.5 Healthcare provider communication (2.5.1 to 2.5.6) verified sender or recipient&#xD;
2.6 Referral coordination (2.6.1 to 2.6.3) ensures referral between authorized providers&#xD;
2.7 Scheduling and activity planning (2.7.1 to 2.7.2) depends on verified workforce metadata&#xD;
2.8 Healthcare provider training (2.8.1 to 2.8.2) linked to licensed provider records&#xD;
2.9 Prescription and medication management (2.9.1 to 2.9.3) only licensed prescribers&#xD;
