3.8.1 to 3.8.3 Health certificate registration, validation, and revocation linked to professional credentials&#xD;
</documentation>
    </element>
    <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="Facility Registry" id="id-daf585bf159243f88c02fe45e8f34b76">
